    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 7th level, the braggart only needs to beat a target’s AC by 4 or more with an attack action they make to apply a compatible flair they know to the attack, and if they beat the target’s AC by 8 or more, they can apply two compatible flairs instead of one.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/braggart#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
